blurb: The school board reviewed updates on athletic facilities, enrollment trends,
  and the implementation of a new electronic device policy. Public comments raised
  concerns about portable classroom safety and student well-being, while the board
  also discussed elementary school reconfiguration and financial transparency with
  the City Council.
